sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant PGO as PostgreSQL (order_service)
    participant OP as Order Outbox publisher
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant IS as Inventory Service
    Client->>OS: POST /api/orders (Idempotency-Key)
    OS->>PGO: one transaction: order (PendingStock) + Outbox row OrderPlaced
    OS-->>Client: 201 Created (PendingStock)
    Note over MQ: broker stopped
    OP->>PGO: SELECT unpublished rows (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
    OP-xMQ: publish OrderPlaced (mandatory, confirm): connection refused
    Note over OP,PGO: row stays unpublished, retried on the next poll
    Note over MQ: broker back
    OP->>MQ: publish OrderPlaced (same MessageId)
    MQ-->>OP: confirm (routed to every required queue)
    OP->>PGO: mark the row published
    MQ->>IS: deliver OrderPlaced (once)
